{"id":"wb-4-12","name":"西山遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"西山遗址 (郑州市)","text":"西山遗址，即郑州西山古城遗址，又称郑州西山仰韶文化城址，位于河南省郑州市北部23公里处的郊岭。该古城遗址中国大陆迄今发现的年代最为久远、建筑技术最为先进的古城遗址。考古专家称此城是黄帝时代的遗址。2011年8月被中国国务院列入国家级大遗址保护片区。1987年公布为郑州市文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E5%B1%B1%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80_(%E9%83%91%E5%B7%9E%E5%B8%82)","revisionId":86461054,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86461054","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c8609dad027f248503fb664c.png","title":"20210503_Sign_of_Xishan_Site.png","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20210503_Sign_of_Xishan_Site.png","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f8/20210503_Sign_of_Xishan_Site.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Sign of Xishan Site","width":320,"height":213}}